  "Only violin data could be read; the violin fractions are used for all four instruments.",
  "Main set A: Demoucron mf; p, mp at 1/3, 2/3 of pp..mf and f halfway mf..ff (equal dB steps between the measured marks). C1/C2: Askenfelt per player inside Clark & Luce 14 dB, outer 5 dB split equally, mp halfway p..mf. B: MuseScore scale linear in dB (the shipped rule). Bounds: pp or ff profile only.",
  "The fraction is applied to the TU Berlin per-pitch pp..ff (extremes of single tones), which is wider than the literature's musical pp..ff (13-14 dB, violin): the markings are placed inside the extremes by fraction.",
